# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Chatbot LLM backend — copy to .env and fill in your provider's values.
# The key is ONLY read server-side (dev middleware / serverless function);
# it is never bundled into client code.
# Any OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions endpoint works.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# REQUIRED — your API key
LLM_API_KEY=

# OPTIONAL — defaults shown below
# OpenAI:      https://api.openai.com/v1          (model: gpt-4o-mini)
# GLM / Zhipu: https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4   (model: glm-4-flash)
# Qwen:        https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1  (model: qwen-plus)
#LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
#LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact form delivery (Resend) — without a key the form automatically
# falls back to the visitor's email app (mailto:), so it never breaks.
# TODO: sign up at resend.com, verify your domain, then fill these in.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
#RESEND_FROM=Portfolio Contact <hello@yourdomain.com>
#CONTACT_TO=zuhaibmahar234@gmail.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Paid booking conflict detection (optional) — without these the booking API
# falls back to per-runtime in-memory storage (works locally; on serverless
# it only enforces holds within a single warm instance).
# TODO: create a free Supabase project + the `bookings` table (SQL in README
# "Custom booking (paid calls)"), then fill these in.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
